<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain Kuwait Insurance Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bahrain Kuwait Insurance Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(Bahraini dinars, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		     161,682   vs    149,082</p>
<p> Gross premium income    2.28 million vs     2.25 million</p>
<p> Net premium income	   695,178   vs     569,647</p>
<p> Investment income	    123,056   vs     97,179</p>
<p>Full name: Bahrain Kuwait Insurance Company.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-536187</p>
</text>
